# zlink Multi Performance Test Policy

> **적용 범위**: zlink 전체 (core + bindings) — multi-client 벤치마크
> **Policy Version**: 1.9
> **Date**: 2026-03-21
> **Scope**: zlink multi-client 성능 테스트 정책
